The data produced by this pipeline rests on CC0 sources only:

- MusicBrainz core data (artists, dates, release groups, relations, URLs),
  from the dump and the official-status snapshots: CC0.
- ListenBrainz listens and popularity statistics: CC0.
- Wikidata (discography classification): CC0.
- Discogs data dump (releases, styles): CC0.

MusicBrainz's supplementary data — genres and tags, which MusicBrainz
publishes under a non-commercial licence — is not read: the extraction drops
it, and no table, versioned test fixture or delivery built from this version
carries it. Deliveries built before it, under data/out/, and the schema loaded
from one of them still carry MusicBrainz genres until the next run and load
replace them.

The licence of the produced dataset, versioned test fixtures and published
deliveries included, is still to be decided by the owner of this repository.

